sequenceDiagram
    participant LLMSvc as LLM Service
    participant OrchSvc as Orchestrator Service
    participant ToolCallRepo as ToolCall Repository
    participant ToolRouter as Tool Router
    participant DraftSvc as Drafting Service
    participant PromptSvc as Prompt Service
    participant SessionRepo as Session Repository
    participant DraftRepo as DraftEmail Repository

    Note over LLMSvc: During conversation turn,<br/>LLM determines email draft needed

    LLMSvc->>OrchSvc: Invoke draft tool
    OrchSvc->>ToolCallRepo: Create ToolCall<br/>{name: "draft_email", input: {audience, purpose, tone, bullets}}
    ToolCallRepo-->>OrchSvc: ToolCall created

    OrchSvc->>ToolRouter: Route to drafting service
    ToolRouter->>DraftSvc: Execute draft generation

    DraftSvc->>PromptSvc: Get session context
    PromptSvc->>SessionRepo: Retrieve session data
    SessionRepo-->>PromptSvc: Session context

    Note over PromptSvc: Assemble bullets<br/>and instructions
    PromptSvc-->>DraftSvc: Draft prompt

    DraftSvc->>LLMSvc: Generate email body
    Note over LLMSvc: Generate with<br/>specified tone & structure
    LLMSvc-->>DraftSvc: Email body text

    DraftSvc->>DraftRepo: Create DraftEmail<br/>{sessionId, audience, purpose, tone, bullets, body}
    DraftRepo-->>DraftSvc: Draft saved {draftId}

    DraftSvc-->>ToolRouter: Draft complete
    ToolRouter-->>OrchSvc: {draftId, success}

    OrchSvc->>ToolCallRepo: Update ToolCall<br/>{output: {draftId}, success: true, latency}

    Note over OrchSvc: Include draft in<br/>assistant response

    OrchSvc-->>LLMSvc: 200 OK with draft content